feat(mc-session/mc-tools/mc-camera): goal 循环升级 + 感知稳定性收尾  - goal 体系: 拆 DEFAULT_LIFE_MISSION(固定使命) + DEFAULT_ACTIVE_GOAL(当前目标), activeGoal 动态化并持久化到 active-goals.json, mc:goal 用 context 函数读最新目标  - mc_set_goal 工具: 换中尺度目标并 clear+re-arm goal(512 兜底)  - goalCooldownMs(3000): agent/pre-step 只对 goal round 降温, 修 Edward 卡楼梯/跳变(工具未落地即再决策)  - armGoal 一律 clear+create, 不再 resume 旧 goal(旧 maxGoalRounds=100000 无限空转), 统一 maxGoalRounds=512  - mc-camera buildBodyMesh: 未知实体画身体方块兜底, 修复 Goddess/新实体被 prismarine-viewer 静默丢弃  - mc-tools: mc_collect 采掘中断报告原因; mc_kill 攻击无效目标停止并建议换招